<title>AUSTRIA: SOCCER-EGYPTIAN INTERNATIONAL JOINS FC TIROL INNSBRUCK.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EGYPTIAN INTERNATIONAL JOINS FC TIROL INNSBRUCK.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian international sweeper Mahmoud Mohamed Hamed Abou El Dahab has signed with Austria's first division FC Tirol Innsbruck, club officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Abou Dahab, 27, who played for Egyptian champions El-Ahli Club Gezera, has been a regular on his national side since 1992.</p>
<p>The 1997-98 Austrian league championship season kicks off next week.</p>
